<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, NOV 5.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, NOV 5.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Nov 5	 Nov 4	 DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  238.240     238.210     237.040    0.51 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  302.120     302.120     303.640   -0.50 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.480     157.530     165.490   -4.84 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.550	46.622	48.410   -3.84 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  393.760     390.620     366.280    7.50 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.460     140.590     147.886   -5.02 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.678	15.713	14.975    4.69 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  209.200     210.940     230.135   -9.10 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.872	 1.874	 1.939   -3.46 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.558	 1.560	 1.575   -1.08 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  187.500     187.690     206.030   -8.99 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
